@startuml 20_Sequence_View_Solution
title View Solution & Interact (Rate/Bookmark/Share) - Sequence Diagram

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor DarkSlateGray
    ActorBorderColor DarkSlateGray
    LifeLineBorderColor DarkSlateGray
    ParticipantBorderColor DarkSlateGray
    ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
}

actor User
participant "SolutionScreen\n(React Native)" as Screen
participant "solutionSlice\n(Redux)" as SolSlice
participant "SolutionService\n(Frontend)" as SolSvc
participant "bookmarkSlice\n(Redux)" as BookSlice
participant "ApiClient\n(Axios)" as ApiClient
participant "ProblemController\n(.NET)" as Controller
participant "GetProblemByIdHandler" as GetHandler
participant "ProblemRepository\n(EF Core)" as Repo
database "MySQL\n(Problem DB)" as DB

== Load Solution ==

User -> Screen : Navigate to SolutionScreen\n(problemId from params)

Screen -> SolSlice : dispatch(fetchSolution(problemId))
activate SolSlice

SolSlice -> SolSvc : getSolution(problemId)
activate SolSvc

SolSvc -> ApiClient : GET /api/v1/problems/{id}\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}
activate ApiClient

ApiClient -> Controller : HTTP GET
activate Controller

Controller -> GetHandler : Send(GetProblemByIdQuery)
activate GetHandler
GetHandler -> Repo : GetByIdAsync(problemId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : SELECT * FROM Problems\nWHERE Id=? AND UserId=?
DB --> Repo : Problem with solution data
deactivate Repo
GetHandler --> Controller : ProblemDto\n{id, status, extractedText,\nsolutionSteps[], confidence}
deactivate GetHandler

Controller --> ApiClient : 200 OK {problem}
deactivate Controller
ApiClient --> SolSvc : Problem with solution
deactivate ApiClient
SolSvc --> SolSlice : SolutionData
deactivate SolSvc

SolSlice -> SolSlice : solutions[problemId] = solutionData
SolSlice -> SolSlice : currentSolution = solutionData
SolSlice -> SolSlice : currentStep = 0
SolSlice --> Screen : Solution state updated
deactivate SolSlice

Screen -> Screen : Render SolutionSteps[0]\n(with KaTeX formula rendering)
Screen --> User : Show step 1 of N

== Navigate Steps ==

User -> Screen : Tap "Next Step"
Screen -> SolSlice : dispatch(nextStep())
SolSlice -> SolSlice : currentStep++
SolSlice --> Screen : currentStep updated
Screen -> Screen : Render SolutionSteps[currentStep]
Screen --> User : Show next step

User -> Screen : Tap "Previous Step"
Screen -> SolSlice : dispatch(prevStep())
SolSlice -> SolSlice : currentStep--
SolSlice --> Screen : currentStep updated
Screen --> User : Show previous step

== Rate Solution ==

User -> Screen : Tap star rating (3 stars)
Screen -> SolSlice : dispatch(rateSolution({solutionId, rating: 3}))
activate SolSlice

SolSlice -> SolSvc : rateSolution(solutionId, 3)
activate SolSvc
SolSvc -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/solutions/{id}/rate\n{rating: 3, feedback: null}
activate ApiClient
ApiClient -> Controller : HTTP POST
Controller --> ApiClient : 200 OK
deactivate ApiClient
SolSvc --> SolSlice : Success
deactivate SolSvc

SolSlice -> SolSlice : userRating = 3
SolSlice --> Screen : Rating saved
deactivate SolSlice
Screen --> User : Show rating saved indicator

== Bookmark Solution ==

User -> Screen : Tap bookmark icon
Screen -> BookSlice : dispatch(addBookmark({problemId}))
activate BookSlice

BookSlice -> BookSlice : Save locally\n(offline first)
BookSlice -> BookSlice : bookmarks.push({id, problemId,\nsolutionSteps, bookmarkedAt})

note over BookSlice : Bookmark stored locally\nvia redux-persist\n(no backend call required)

BookSlice --> Screen : Bookmark saved
deactivate BookSlice
Screen --> User : Bookmark icon highlighted

== Share Solution ==

User -> Screen : Tap share button
Screen --> User : Show share options modal\n(Text / Image / PDF / Link / Copy)

User -> Screen : Select "Export as Image"
Screen -> Screen : Capture screenshot\n(expo-view-shot)
Screen -> Screen : expo-sharing.shareAsync(imageUri)
Screen --> User : Native share sheet opens

@enduml
